                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.5151/122: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">White</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-06-09T14:00:00-04:00">June 9, 1933—2 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>34. Your 51, June 7, 6 p.m. You are authorized to present to the Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs an <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> on each of these
                    subjects.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
